    "body": "In fact, this model mainly learns the mapping between the agent’s and the user’s facial expressions and voices: if the user smiles, the avatar may smile as well; if the user speaks in a neutral tone, the avatar may nod, since such mappings appear frequently in the dataset. If you want explicit control over actions such as nodding or frowning, you may refer to the paper InstructAvatar.",
